Here is the metrics overview dashboard UI tailored to your brief. 

To present the four KPI tiles and the comparison chart beautifully, we'll use a balanced two-column layout:
- **Left Column**: The dashboard header, subtitle, and a compact grid containing the four metric/KPI tiles (revenue, uptime, response time, and signups) with clear positive/negative trend indicators.
- **Right Column**: An interactive `chartjs_bar` chart displaying a week-by-week performance-to-target comparison.

### Step 1: Create the Surface
First, we signal the client to create the new UI surface.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "metrics-overview-dashboard",
    "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-data-display.json"
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

### Step 2: Render the Components
Next, we define the component tree starting with the two-column layout as the root.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "metrics-overview-dashboard",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "columns",
        "cols": 2,
        "gap": "2rem",
        "items": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "dashboard-heading",
                "component": "heading",
                "text": "Executive Performance Overview"
              },
              {
                "id": "dashboard-sub",
                "component": "body",
                "text": "Real-time key performance indicators tracking financial growth and system health metrics."
              },
              {
                "id": "kpi-metrics",
                "component": "metric_row",
                "cols": 2,
                "metrics": [
                  {
                    "value": "$24,500",
                    "label": "Weekly Revenue",
                    "trend": "up",
                    "accent": "#10B981"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "99.8%",
                    "label": "System Uptime",
                    "trend": "up",
                    "accent": "#10B981"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "1.2s",
                    "label": "Avg Response Time",
                    "trend": "down",
                    "accent": "#EF4444"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "452",
                    "label": "New Signups",
                    "trend": "up",
                    "accent": "#10B981"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "chart-heading",
                "component": "heading",
                "text": "Weekly Revenue vs. Target"
              },
              {
                "id": "revenue-comparison-chart",
                "component": "chartjs_bar",
                "labels": ["Week 1", "Week 2", "Week 3", "Week 4"],
                "datasets": [
                  {
                    "label": "Actual Revenue ($)",
                    "data": [18000, 21000, 19500, 24500]
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Target Revenue ($)",
                    "data": [17000, 19000, 20000, 22000]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
</a2ui-json>
